	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_SMR_smr_loot_repair_parts_spawn">
		<text>產生零件維修物品</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_SMR_smr_loot_repair_parts_spawn_desc">
		<text>啟用/禁用作為小修套件的零件維修專案. 如果你不想費心修理/更換武器和裝備部件,你可以禁用相關物品的產生. </text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_SMR_smr_loot_repair_chance">
		<text>修理包機會</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_SMR_smr_loot_repair_chance_desc">
